=Raptor=
*  Health: 5
*  Price: %Minerals% 80
*  [[concepts/scanning range|Scanning range]]: 7
*  [[concepts/attack range|Hrz. Attack range]]: 7 (Missile)
*  Can attack independently of movement action
*  Does not require ammunition
*  2 attacks per round
*  Explosion radius: 1
*  Damage: 5
This plane-turret type can attack objects in range.
*  Plane (Base)
*  Can climb 1 height level up
*  Can safely fall down 1 height level
*  Overweight: 10
*  Stationary on ground (supported by water)
*  Speed: 10 (aerial)
Sub orbital planes move above the regular terrain. They can scan the surface, and are invisible to ordinary radar.
